  "globalSearch-instructions-heading": "thaqaña Instructions",
  "globalSearch-instructions-description": "Searches can include operators ukaru refine the thaqaña.  Operators apxi specified by writing the operator suti ukat value separated by a colon.  For example, an operator specification -na `list:Blocked` would limit the thaqaña ukaru tarjetanaka uka apxi contained mana a lista named *Blocked*.  If the value contains spaces jan ukax special characters it must be enclosed mana quotation marks (e.g. `__operator_list__:\"To Review\"`).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operators": "Utjiri luririnaka:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-board": "`__operator_board__:<title>` - tarjetanaka mana pirqanaka matching the specified *<title>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-list": "`__operator_list__:<title>` - tarjetanaka mana listanaka matching the specified *<title>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-swimlane": "`__operator_swimlane__:<title>` - tarjetanaka mana swimlanes matching the specified *<title>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-comment": "`__operator_comment__:<text>` - tarjetanaka mpi a amuytʼawi containing *<text>*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-label": "`__operator_label__:<color>` `__operator_label__:<name>` - tarjetanaka uka have a chimpuncha matching *<color>* jan ukax *<name>",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-hash": "`__operator_label_abbrev__<name|color>` - shorthand for `__operator_label__:<color>` jan ukax `__operator_label__:<name>`",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-user": "`__operator_user__:<username>` - tarjetanaka where *<username>* awa a *miembro* jan ukax *assignee*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-at": "`__operator_user_abbrev__username` - `user:<username>` ukatakix jisk'achat qillqawi",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-member": "`__operator_member__:<username>` - tarjetanaka where *<username>* awa a *miembro*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-assignee": "`__operator_assignee__:<username>` - tarjetanaka where *<username>* awa an *assignee*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-creator": "`__operator_creator__:<username>` - tarjetanaka where *<username>* awa the card's creator",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-org": "`__operator_org__:<display name|short name>` - tarjetanaka belonging ukaru a pirqa assigned ukaru tantachawi *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-team": "`__operator_team__:<display name|short name>` - tarjetanaka belonging ukaru a pirqa assigned ukaru tama *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-due": "`__operator_due__:<n>` - tarjetanaka which apxi tukuyañ up ukaru *<n>* urunaka ukata now.  `__operator_due__:__predicate_overdue__ listanaka taqi tarjetanaka past their tukuyañ uru.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-created": "`__operator_created__:<n>` - tarjetanaka which were uñstayata *<n>* urunaka ago jan ukax jukʼaki",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-modified": "`__operator_modified__:<n>` - tarjetanaka which were modified *<n>* urunaka ago jan ukax jukʼaki",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-status": "`__operator_status__:<status>` - where *<status>* awa one -na the following:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-archived": "`__predicate_archived__` - imata tarjetanaka",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-all": "`__predicate_all__` - taqi imata ukat unarchived tarjetanaka",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-ended": "`__predicate_ended__` - tarjetanaka mpi an tukuya uru",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-public": "`__predicate_public__` - tarjetanaka akiwa mana taqinitaki pirqanaka",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-private": "`__predicate_private__` - tarjetanaka akiwa mana jamasata pirqanaka",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-has": "`__operator_has__:<field>` - where *<field>* awa one -na `__predicate_attachment__`, `__predicate_checklist__`, `__predicate_description__`, `__predicate_start__`, `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_end__`, `__predicate_assignee__` jan ukax `__predicate_member__`.  Placing a `-` mana front -na *<field>* searches for the absence -na a value mana uka field (e.g. `has:-due` searches for tarjetanaka jani a tukuyañ uru).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-sort": "`__operator_sort__:<sort-name>` - where *<sort-name>* awa one -na `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_created__` jan ukax `__predicate_modified__`.  For a descending sort, place a `-` mana front -na the sort suti.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-limit": "`__operator_limit__:<n>` - where *<n>* awa a positive integer expressing the jakhu -na tarjetanaka ukaru be displayed per page.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-1": "Walja luririnakaw qhanañchasispa.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-2": "Similar operators apxi *jan ukax*ed together.  tarjetanaka uka match kawkiri -na the conditions will be returned.\n`__operator_list__:Available __operator_list__:Blocked` would return tarjetanaka contained mana kawkiri lista named *Blocked* jan ukax *Available*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3": "Differing operators apxi *ukat*ed together.  akiwa tarjetanaka uka match taqi -na the differing operators apxi returned.  `__operator_list__:Available __operator_label__:red` returns akiwa tarjetanaka mana the lista *Available* mpi a *red* chimpuncha.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3-2": "urunaka can be specified as a positive jan ukax negative integer jan ukax using `__predicate_week__`, `__predicate_month__`, `__predicate_quarter__` jan ukax `__predicate_year__` for the jichha period.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-4": "qillqa searches apxi case insensitive.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-5": "By nayrïri imata tarjetanaka apxi jani searched.",
