  "password-length-report-desc": "Jakhuwinaka, imantata aru jisk'ampimpi mantapki, juk'a jach'atxa jisk'akiwa. Navegadorakiw imantata aru qhawqha jach'achixa uk yati, ukatwa mantatat qhipat jisk'a imantata aru yatiyi; imantata aru, jach'apasa janipuniw navegadorat mistki. Askichatawa, jakhuwin imantata arupa mayjt'ayatäki uka pachawa - mayamp jisk'a imantata arumpi mantki uka jakhuwixa mayampiw sinti jisk'jam uñacht'ayasi.",
  "password-length-saved": "Imatawa.",
  "password-min-length": "Imantata aru juk'a jach'a",
  "password-min-length-description": "Jisk'ampi imantata arumpi mantawixa aka manqhan qillqatawa. Mantawixa janipuniw ukatxa jark'atäkiti.",
  "password-min-length-enforce": "Juk'a jach'a phuqhayaña",
  "password-min-length-enforce-description": "Machaq jisk'a imantata aruxa janiw katuqatäkiti, ukat jisk'a imantata arumpi mantki uka jakhuwixa yaqha luräwinak nayraqatxa mayjt'ayañapawa. Mayjt'ayañaxa jakhuwin taqpach sesionanakap mistuyi. LDAP, OAuth2, OIDC, SAML, CAS, Sandstorm imantata arunakaxa churirinakapankiwa, janiw uñakipatäkiti.",
  "password-change-required-text": "Aka sitioxa jichhax __min__ qillqanakat juk'ampi imantata arunak mayi, jumanxa jisk'awa. Sarantañatakix juk'amp jach'a ajllim. Ukatxa jakhuwiman taqpach sesionanakapax mistuyatawa, ukat machaq imantata arumpiw mayamp mantäta.",
