  "show-unread-changes-desc": "Mä karta, suti, qhanancht'awi, urunaka, chimpunaka, masinaka, uñakipaña sutinaka, chikt'atanaka jan ukax arsutanakapax qhipa jist'arataman qhipatxa mayjt'ayatäspa ukhax, ch'uxña q'awa mini kartapan katuqi, jist'arañkama.",
  "keep-title-tags": "#unanchana @masina machaqa kartan p'iqi sutipan imaña",
  "keep-title-tags-description": "Machaqa kartan p'iqi sutip qillqkasaxa # ukamp mä unanchana jan ukax @ ukamp mä masi ajllisax, uka qillqax p'iqi sutinx qhiparaskiniwa. Jist'arata: uka qillqax unanchanampi jan ukax masimpiw turkasi.",
  "show-focus-outline": "Qhanstayaña muyu uñachtʼayaña",
