  "keep-add-card-form-open-description": "Naktayata: karta yapatatxa, formulariox jist'aratakiw qhipa kartataki ch'usa sutimpi. Jiwt'ayata: formulariox jist'antasiwa karta yapatatxa.",
  "title-bracket-label": "Machaqa kartan p'iqi sutipan qalltapan [unanchana] unanchar tukuyaña",
  "title-bracket-label-description": "Machaqa kartan p'iqi sutipax [Qillqa] ukamp qalltani ukatsti juk'amp qillqax arkani ukhaxa, Qillqax kartan unanchapaw tuku (pirqan uka sutin unanchax janiw utjkchi ukhax lurataw) ukatsti p'iqi sutit apsutaw. Jist'arata: p'iqi sutix kunjamatix ukhamaw qhipari.",
  "submit-on-enter": "Submit editors mpi qillqantaña",
  "submit-on-enter-description": "When patana, pressing qillqantaña saves the tarjeta pʼiqiñcha, qhanañchäwi ukat other inline editors; Shift+qillqantaña inserts a machaqa line. When off, Ctrl/Cmd+qillqantaña saves ukat qillqantaña inserts a machaqa line.",
